40:          left top->bottom  = F1, F2, F3
41:          right top->bottom = S3, S2, S1   (because solids stack from bottom upward)
42:          slotwise color swap:
43:            slot 0: F1 takes color(S3), S3 takes color(F1)
44:            slot 1: F2 takes color(S2), S2 takes color(F2)
45:            slot 2: F3 takes color(S1), S1 takes color(F3)
